      "source": "https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Seagraves%2C_Texas"
    },
    {
      "id": 3,
      "text": "The historic Simpson Hotel survived a 1928 fire and was awarded a Texas Historical Commission Medallion in 1992 for its resilience.",
